prompt --application/pages/page_00002
begin
wwv_flow_imp_page.create_page(
 p_id=>2
,p_name=>'Expense Report'
,p_alias=>'EXPENSE-REPORT'
,p_step_title=>'Expense Report'
,p_autocomplete_on_off=>'OFF'
,p_step_template=>4075783602716660119
,p_page_template_options=>'#DEFAULT#'
,p_protection_level=>'C'
,p_help_text=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<h3>When to use</h3>',
'<p>Use a full-page form when a record has enough fields to benefit from named sections and more space than a modal provides.</p>',
'<h3>About this form</h3>',
'<p>The native section selector offers Show All, Report and Employee, Trip Details, Accounting and Approval Contact, and Justification and Reimbursement. The fields demonstrate required text, email and phone inputs, dates, lookup choices, a CLOB-backe'
||'d justification longer than 32 KB, and signed advances or credits. Travel End must be on or after Travel Start when both dates are provided.</p>',
'<h3>How the components work together</h3>',
'<ul>',
'<li><strong>Form Initialization:</strong> Uses the hidden report identifier to load a record.</li>',
'<li><strong>Form region and native items:</strong> Bind fields to the report table and apply their validation settings.</li>',
'<li><strong>Automatic Row Processing and a page branch:</strong> Save the record and return to the report list after Create, Save, or Delete.</li>',
'</ul>',
'<p>Cancel returns without saving report-field edits. Add Expense is available for a saved report and opens a drawer with that report selected. Saving an expense is separate from saving the report; canceling the report does not undo an expense already'
||' saved in the drawer.</p>',
'<p>Delete requires confirmation and also removes the report''s expense lines and receipts. Status and Policy Reviewed are demonstration fields; no approval or payment workflow is executed.</p>'))
,p_page_component_map=>'02'
);
